advanced.description:
{Advanced Summon Gold Golems}

Summons Gold Golems to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of GoldGolems summoned is 50% greater than Basic Summon Gold Golems.

expert.description:
{Expert Summon Gold Golems}

Summons Gold Golems to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of GoldGolems summoned is 100% greater than Basic Summon Gold Golems.
